      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if we miss the next promised milestone is Pioneer Freight Solutions. They are running a tactical PoC of NoiseGuard, a lower-cost competitor focused on quick, easy alert noise reduction, and their executive mandate is to reduce manual work caused by degraded search relevance and entity graph linking after a taxonomy change. The exact milestone at risk is the acceptance of the remediation plan for the taxonomy change, specifically the backfill and index recomputation phase scheduled from 2026-04-12 to 2026-04-30, with validation from 2026-05-01 to 2026-05-14. The acceptance criteria include achieving precision@10 >= 0.8 for facility lookups, entity-link hit rate >= 90%, and grouping false positives <= 5%. Failure to meet these milestones and acceptance criteria risks the customer extending NoiseGuard usage and reducing scope with Northstar, increasing retention risk [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_ac8afb52f2d3].\n\nIn summary:\n- Customer: Pioneer Freight Solutions\n- Milestone: Backfill enrichment and recompute index weights from 2026-04-12 to 2026-04-30, followed by validation window 2026-05-01 to 2026-05-14 with defined acceptance criteria\n- Risk: Missing this milestone likely leads to procurement favoring NoiseGuard, a cheaper tactical competitor [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_ac8afb52f2d3].",
